      {
        "text": "Jessica Vásquez was appointed 8th District Cook County Commissioner in May 2025. She previously was chief of staff to 35th Ward Alderman Carlos Ramirez-Rosa and worked at the Illinois Coalition for Immigrant and Refugee Rights. Her campaign says she helped manage $1.5 million for playgrounds, ballfields, and pedestrian safety through a participatory budgeting process.",
